<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  Thanks for your order
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Delivered
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We are glad to confirm that your order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> has been delivered. Thank you for shopping with Dukka — we hope you enjoy your purchase.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Delivered"}}
  {{#if points_earned}}
  {{> detail-row label="Points earned" value=points_earned}}
  {{/if}}
{{/details}}

{{#if points_earned}}
{{#> tip title="Points added"}}
  You earned {{points_earned}} points for completing this order. They are already in your Dukka account balance.
{{/tip}}
{{/if}}

{{#> tip title="How was it?"}}
  Your feedback helps other shoppers. When you have a moment, leave a quick review from your orders page.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thanks again for choosing Dukka. If anything is wrong with your delivery, reply to this email and we will help.
</p>
